Package: brand
Title: Personal Brand for Quarto and pkgdown
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Visruth", "Srimath Kandali", , "public@visruth.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Custom theming using a single 'brand.yml' file that 'Quarto' reads directly, paired
    with the 'pkgdown' template package that consumes the same file, so
    documents, websites, and package reference sites share one light and dark
    theme.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://brand.visruth.com/, https://github.com/VisruthSK/brand
BugReports: https://github.com/VisruthSK/brand/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    brand.yml,
    yaml
Suggests:
    knitr,
    pkgdown,
    quarto
VignetteBuilder:
    quarto
Config/Needs/website:
    VisruthSK/brand
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
